# SquareBank™ (Platform Build Spec #012)

Financial source of truth — **not customer-facing**. SquareWallet™ is presentation only.

## Rules

- **All balance mutations** through `SquareBankEngine.postEntry()` — never direct balance UPDATE in app code
- **Immutable ledger** — no UPDATE/DELETE on `square_bank_ledger`
- **Unique IDs** — `TransactionIdService` generates `SQ-YYYY-00000012345`
- PaymentEngine records provider refs; SquareBank records ledger truth
- Do not alter payout calculation amounts
- Admin routes require `getAuthorizedAdminUser()`

## Adding a ledger entry type

1. Add to `SquareBankLedgerEntryType` in `types.ts`
2. Add wallet presentation mapping in `config.ts` `BANK_TO_WALLET_ENTRY_TYPE`
3. Wire calling service through `postEntry()`

## Adding an account type

1. Add to migration check constraint + `SquareBankAccountType` in `types.ts`
2. Add to `ALL_SQUARE_BANK_ACCOUNT_TYPES` in `config.ts`
3. Map to wallet presentation in `balanceMapping.ts`

Full spec: `docs/project-legacy/SQUARE_BANK.md`
